      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Workflow D: global error handler\nSet as *Error workflow* in the settings of A, B and C. Fires on any uncaught crash. Marks rows still `processing` under the crashed execution id as `failed` (so nothing is stranded until the stale-claim re-pick), then posts to the alerts channel.",
